  "chitchat": [
    "inclines his head a precise few degrees. \"Welcome to Solenne. Mind the marble — it's just been done.\"",
    "\"Anything at all, you ring the bell and it's handled. Discreetly.\"",
    "glances at the door, then back to you, and says nothing at all — which is itself a kind of message.",
    "\"The Sky Deck is residents only, I'm afraid. But the view from the lobby glass isn't nothing.\""
  ],
  "description": "Marchetti runs the front of Solenne the way a good surgeon runs a theatre — nothing wasted, nothing seen that shouldn't be. Charcoal three-piece, a lapel pin shaped like the tower, and a memory for faces that has kept more people out of this lobby than any lock. He is unfailingly warm and absolutely immovable.",
